                <pb facs="0147" n="137" sameAs="frus:frus1937v05/pg137"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">738.39/110: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Norweb</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ciudad
                                Trujillo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-11-17T12:00:00-05:00">November 17,
                        1937—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received 1:30 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>46. The message from the President of Mexico was received this morning and
                    replied to in identic terms with the answer sent President Roosevelt.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Norweb</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
